cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the candidate list it releases, please cite both the archived release and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "pfas-domain-screening: criterion-dependent applicability-domain analysis and a read-across priority list of 2,390 emerging PFAS alternatives"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/echo8497/pfas-domain-screening"

abstract: >-
  Screens all 19,767 unique structures of the US EPA PFASSTRUCT V6 suspect list
  against a 26-endpoint PFAS bioactivity panel, quantifies how far the panel's
  applicability domain extends over replacement chemistry under five different
  criteria, and releases a tiered read-across priority list of 2,390 candidate
  alternatives.
keywords:
  - per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances
  - applicability domain
  - machine learning
  - chemical space
  - read-across
  - regrettable substitution
  - data leakage
  - suspect screening
